    """
    Convert a datetime from one timezone to another using the Pendulum library.

    Parameters
    - dt_input: str or datetime.datetime or pendulum.DateTime
        If a string, it will be parsed. If `fmt` is provided, it will be parsed using that format
        (Pendulum's format tokens, e.g. "YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm:ss"). Otherwise `pendulum.parse` is used.
