- This uses pydantic (v2) for robust parsing: XYZModel.model_validate(...) is the pydantic v2 validation entrypoint.
- Unhashable values (lists/dicts) are converted to their repr for counting so they can be used as dictionary keys. Adjust that behavior if you'd prefer a different representation.

